# CMS auto-backups — the directory is scratch, but a workspace committed as a
# durable artefact is re-included by name below. Ignore the *contents*, not the
# directory itself: git cannot re-include a file inside an ignored directory.
cms/backups/*
# ⚠️ The P2.5 tagged corpus. The CMS's File Manager serves workspaces from this
# directory (`cms/vite-plugin-cms-api.js`), so it has to live here to be
# loadable — but the tags are the only copy outside `data/`, and a fresh clone
# with no workspace is how a Sync wipes content (R-18). Tracked deliberately.
!cms/backups/cms-workspace-2026-08-28-p25-tagged.json

